            "tolerance": 4,
            "note": "Accounts item, near the top of its selection background (spec: preferences-toolbar, Selection background top, measured on General)"
          },
          {
            "x": 58,
            "y": 74.25,
            "color": "#bababa",
            "tolerance": 5,
            "note": "Accounts item, near the bottom of its selection background (spec: Selection background bottom, measured on General); the pressed pointer is still over the item, which has no hover state"
